#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0172 expect=executionError domain=SS
#expect-execution-error "group= over 'DS' has no usable key"
#note "PLAN-join-key-one-side-absent-drop QK16 (b) / QK18 (owner 2026-10-11): DS without USUBJID - the domain= call's only group= member is on the evaluated side only, so no key member is left on both sides and the rule ERRORs (never an aggregate over the whole of DS). Derived from CDISC-CG0172-invalid-SS.cdt with DS.USUBJID removed. A gate declaring DS.USUBJID would turn this into a SKIP."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SS label="Subject Status"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SSSTRESC type=Char label="Character Result/Finding in Std Format"
col SSDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Collection"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SS | 01-701-1015 | DEAD | 2013-01-01
---

dataset DS label=Disposition
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col DSSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col DSSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Disposition Event"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DS | 1 | 2014-01-14
CDISCPILOT01 | DS | 2 | 2014-07-02
---
